<title>USA: Clean Harbors credit facility extended.</title>
<headline>Clean Harbors credit facility extended.</headline>
<dateline>BRAINTREE, Mass. 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Clean Harbors Inc said Wednesday that its commercial lender, Congress Financial Corp, has extended the company's current $35 million revolving credit facility until May 8, 1999.</p>
<p>The company also said that it was in full compliance with all convenants and conditions of the loan.</p>
<p>Clean Harbors provides comprehensive environmental and industrial waste services to a nationwide customer base.</p>
</text>
